Here’s the current door status:

```json
{
  "doorStatus": {
    "driver": "unlocked",
    "passenger": "unlocked",
    "rear_left": "unlocked",
    "rear_right": "unlocked"
  }
}
```

All four doors are currently unlocked. To lock them, I’ll lock each door individually. After locking, I’ll start the engine.

**Step 1 – Lock all doors**

```json
{
  "door": "driver",
  "action": "lock"
}
```

(Note: The system doesn’t have a single “lock all” command, so I’ll lock each door one at a time.)

